Z||000000||FOCONE||03-19-2001||08:37 PM||||Hello Fellow Fiero Owners,<P>I would like to announce that the Fiero Owners Club of New England has<BR>begun another membership drive.  The goal of our membership drive is to<BR>see if we can welcome 1 new member from each State here in the USA and 1<BR>member from each Province in Canada.<P>So please come on and help us complete our goal.  We hold two Fiero Only<BR>car shows each year (Old Orchard Beach, ME in June and Rutland, MA in<BR>September) and produce a club magazine 4 times a year.  Our club<BR>officers live in (listed from south to north) New Jersey, Connecticut,<BR>Massachusetts and Maine.<P>If you have any questions or would like to receive a membership<BR>application, please drop me a note.  I would be happy to E-mail you a<BR>form.  Also, if you join our club and pre-register for our summer show<BR>(Old Orchard Beach, ME June 15,16, 2001) before April 30, 2001 you will<BR>receive FREE 1 Cars and Concepts T-top poster (C&C T-top posters donated<BR>by Fiero Parts and Appraisals).  Posters will be handed out at our<BR>summer show only.<P>Membership is only $17.00 in the U.S.<BR>$20.00 out side the U.S. in U.S. funds please.<P>This years show fee is ($15.00 for non-members) and you can  subtract $5.00 for pre-registration buy May 30th 2001<P>Members pay $12.00 -$5.00 for pre-registration buy May 30th 2001<P>Plus the first 50 to sign up for the show and become a member will get a t-top poster free poster....<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroparts.com/ebay/021501/ttopdealerposter.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroparts.com/ebay/021501/ttopdealerposter.jpg</A>  <P>Thank you all for the space.<P>Chris Schaefer<BR>FOCONE Membership Director/Editor<P>Chris.Schaefer@focone.org   or<BR>focone@focone.org<P>[This message has been edited by FOCONE (edited 03-19-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by FOCONE (edited 03-19-2001).]||||reg||1
